cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LitAnchor (the ZCode edition of LitExtract) in your work,
  please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: 'LitAnchor: Literature Data Extraction for ZCode (lit-extract skill)'
authors:
  - alias: Axl1Huang
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-09-29'
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/zhaorui-bi/LitAnchor'
abstract: >-
  ZCode-native edition of the LitExtract pipeline for structured
  literature data extraction from PDF papers: text anchoring, selective
  visual reading of data pages, in-session constrained extraction, and
  three-level hard validation, with zero metered API cost.
keywords:
  - literature-data-extraction
  - PDF
  - PyMuPDF
  - ZCode-skill
  - adsorption
